function idChanged(form:any){const value=String(form.idNumber||'').toUpperCase();if(/^\d{17}[0-9X]$/.test(value))form.gender=Number(value.charAt(16))%2?'MALE':'FEMALE'}
const stallLabel=(s:any)=>`${s.floorName||s.floorCode||''} ${s.stallCode} ${s.currentMerchantName||s.stallName||''}`.trim()
async function searchStalls(keyword:string){stallLoading.value=true;try{const r:any=await stallApi.page({keyword,pageNum:1,pageSize:30});stallOptions.value=r.records||[]}finally{stallLoading.value=false}}
function stallSelected(form:any){const s=stallOptions.value.find(x=>x.id===form.stallId);if(s)form.organizationName=s.currentMerchantName||s.stallName||s.stallCode}
function affiliationChanged(form:any){if(form.affiliationType!=='STALL')form.stallId=null}
async function editSelf(){selfForm.value={...selfData.value.person,gender:selfData.value.person?.gender||'UNKNOWN',affiliationType:selfData.value.person?.affiliationType||'EXTERNAL'};if(selfForm.value.stallId)await searchStalls(selfForm.value.organizationName||'');selfVisible.value=true}
async function saveSelf(){await accessControlApi.updateSelf(selfForm.value);ElMessage.success('个人资料已保存');selfVisible.value=false;await load()}
async function claimSelf(){await accessControlApi.claimSelf(claimForm.value);ElMessage.success('身份验证成功，人员档案已认领');claimVisible.value=false;claimForm.value={phone:'',idNumber:''};await load();await editSelf()}
function editPerson(r:any={}){personForm.value={...r,idNumber:'',gender:r.gender||'UNKNOWN',affiliationType:r.affiliationType||'EXTERNAL',personType:'LONG_TERM',sourceType:r.sourceType||'SYSTEM',managedBySystem:r.managedBySystem||false,faceStatus:r.faceStatus||'UNKNOWN',personStatus:r.personStatus||'PENDING_REVIEW'};personVisible.value=true}async function savePerson(){await accessControlApi.savePerson(personForm.value);ElMessage.success('人员资料已保存');personVisible.value=false;load()}async function showPerson(r:any){detail.value=await accessControlApi.person(r.id) as any;faceData.value='';faceMessage.value='正在从设备读取人脸照片…';detailVisible.value=true;try{const face:any=await accessControlApi.personFace(r.id);faceData.value=`data:${face.mimeType||'image/jpeg'};base64,${face.dataBase64}`;faceMessage.value=''}catch(e){faceMessage.value='设备暂无可读取的人脸照片或当前离线'}}
function dateText(d:Date){const p=(n:number)=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');return `${d.getFullYear()}-${p(d.getMonth()+1)}-${p(d.getDate())} ${p(d.getHours())}:${p(d.getMinutes())}:${p(d.getSeconds())}`}
function openVisitor(){const from=new Date(),to=new Date(from);to.setFullYear(to.getFullYear()+1);visitorForm.value={gender:'UNKNOWN',affiliationType:'STALL',validFrom:dateText(from),validTo:dateText(to)};visitorFiles.value={};stallOptions.value=[];visitorVisible.value=true}
function visitorAffiliationChanged(){visitorForm.value.stallId=null;visitorForm.value.visitorCompany=visitorForm.value.affiliationType==='PROPERTY'?'物业部':visitorForm.value.affiliationType==='COMMERCIAL'?'商管部':''}
function selectVisitorFile(type:string,event:Event){const input=event.target as HTMLInputElement;visitorFiles.value={...visitorFiles.value,[type]:input.files?.[0]}}
async function createVisitor(){for(const type of ['ID_FRONT','ID_BACK','FACE'])if(!visitorFiles.value[type]){ElMessage.warning('请上传身份证正反面和人脸照片');return}visitorSaving.value=true;try{const result:any=await accessControlApi.createVisitor(visitorForm.value);for(const type of ['ID_FRONT','ID_BACK','FACE'])await accessControlApi.uploadVisitorPhoto(result.id,type,visitorFiles.value[type]);ElMessage.success('访客资料已提交审批');visitorVisible.value=false;load()}finally{visitorSaving.value=false}}async function decideVisitor(r:any,decision:string){const rejecting=decision==='REJECTED';const {value}=await ElMessageBox.prompt(rejecting?'确认拒绝该预约，请填写原因':'通过后将同步入口、出口两台设备，可填写审批说明','访客预约审批',{inputType:'textarea',inputPattern:rejecting?/\S+/:undefined,inputErrorMessage:rejecting?'拒绝时必须填写原因':undefined});const result:any=await accessControlApi.decideVisitor(r.id,{decision,approvalNote:value});if(result.status==='ACTIVE')ElMessage.success('审批通过，入口和出口设备已同步并校验一致');else if(result.status==='SYNC_FAILED')ElMessage.error(result.approvalNote||'设备同步失败，可修复后重试');else ElMessage.success('审批已完成');visitorDetailVisible.value=false;await load()}async function revokeVisitor(r:any){const {value}=await ElMessageBox.prompt('撤销后将立即从入口、出口设备删除权限，系统快照保留6个月。请输入原因','撤销门禁权限',{inputType:'textarea',inputPattern:/\S+/,inputErrorMessage:'必须填写撤销原因'});await accessControlApi.revokeVisitor(r.id,value);ElMessage.success('两台设备权限已删除，记录进入6个月保留期');load()}
async function showVisitor(r:any){clearVisitorPhotos();visitorDetail.value=await accessControlApi.visitor(r.id) as any;visitorDetailVisible.value=true;for(const a of visitorDetail.value.attachments||[]){try{const blob:any=await accessControlApi.visitorPhoto(r.id,a.id);visitorPhotoUrls.value[a.id]=URL.createObjectURL(blob)}catch{visitorPhotoErrors.value[a.id]=true}}}
function clearVisitorPhotos(){Object.values(visitorPhotoUrls.value).forEach(URL.revokeObjectURL);visitorPhotoUrls.value={};visitorPhotoErrors.value={}}
function openImage(url:string){window.open(url,'_blank')}
async function deleteVisitor(r:any){await ElMessageBox.confirm(`将彻底删除测试申请“${r.appointmentNo||r.visitorName}”及关联审批、设备同步、附件记录，此操作无法恢复。确认继续？`,'超级管理员彻底删除',{type:'error',confirmButtonText:'确认彻底删除'});await accessControlApi.deleteVisitor(r.id);ElMessage.success('测试申请及关联资料已彻底删除');visitorDetailVisible.value=false;await load()}
async function deletePerson(r:any){await ElMessageBox.confirm(`将先从入口、出口设备删除“${r.personName}”，设备全部删除成功后才会彻底删除本系统人员资料。此操作无法恢复，确认继续？`,'超级管理员彻底删除人员',{type:'error',confirmButtonText:'确认从设备及系统删除'});await accessControlApi.deletePerson(r.id);ElMessage.success('人员已从门禁设备及本系统彻底删除');detailVisible.value=false;await load()}
async function syncEvents(){eventSyncing.value=true;try{const result:any=await accessControlApi.syncEvents();ElMessage.success(result.message||'通行记录同步完成');await load()}finally{eventSyncing.value=false}}
async function loadEventThumbs(rows:any[]){for(const r of rows.filter(x=>x.hasSnapshot)){try{const blob:any=await accessControlApi.eventThumbnail(r.id);eventPhotoUrls.value={...eventPhotoUrls.value,[r.id]:URL.createObjectURL(blob)}}catch{}}}
async function changeEventPage(page:number){eventPage.value=page;await load()}
async function changeEventPageSize(size:number){eventPageSize.value=size;eventPage.value=1;await load()}
function releaseEventOriginal(){if(eventPhotoCurrent.value){URL.revokeObjectURL(eventPhotoCurrent.value);eventPhotoCurrent.value=''}}
function clearEventPhotos(){Object.values(eventPhotoUrls.value).forEach(URL.revokeObjectURL);eventPhotoUrls.value={};releaseEventOriginal();eventPhotoVisible.value=false}
async function showEventSnapshot(r:any){try{releaseEventOriginal();const blob:any=await accessControlApi.eventSnapshot(r.id);eventPhotoCurrent.value=URL.createObjectURL(blob);eventPhotoVisible.value=true}catch{ElMessage.error('照片已超过一个月保存期或读取失败')}}
function closeEventPhoto(){eventPhotoVisible.value=false;releaseEventOriginal()}
async function replaceVisitorFace(event:Event){const file=(event.target as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0];if(!file)return;await accessControlApi.uploadVisitorPhoto(visitorDetail.value.id,'FACE',file);ElMessage.success('人脸照片已更新，请确认预览后再重试同步');await showVisitor(visitorDetail.value)}
async function requestRenewal(){await ElMessageBox.confirm('续期从当前到期时间开始顺延一年；如已过期，则从当前时间开始计算。确认提交？','申请门禁续期',{type:'info'});await accessControlApi.requestRenewal();ElMessage.success('续期申请已提交，等待管理员审核');await load()}
async function decideRenewal(r:any,decision:string){const rejecting=decision==='REJECTED';const {value}=await ElMessageBox.prompt(rejecting?'请输入拒绝原因':'通过后将自动更新入口和出口设备的有效期，可填写审批说明','续期审批',{inputType:'textarea',inputPattern:rejecting?/\S+/:undefined,inputErrorMessage:rejecting?'拒绝时必须填写原因':undefined});const result:any=await accessControlApi.decideRenewal(r.id,{decision,approvalNote:value});if(result.status==='ACTIVE')ElMessage.success('续期审批完成，两台设备有效期已更新');else if(result.status==='SYNC_FAILED')ElMessage.error(result.approvalNote||'设备下发失败，可重试');else ElMessage.success('续期申请已处理');await load()}
async function generateReview(){const {value}=await ElMessageBox.prompt('超过多少天未通行时生成复核任务？','生成复核',{inputValue:'60',inputPattern:/^\d+$/,inputErrorMessage:'请输入天数'});const n=await accessControlApi.generateReviews(Number(value));ElMessage.success(`已新增 ${n} 条复核任务`);load()}async function review(r:any,decision:string){const {value}=await ElMessageBox.prompt('请填写复核说明','人员复核',{inputType:'textarea'});await accessControlApi.decideReview(r.id,{decision,decisionNote:value});ElMessage.success('复核已完成，不会自动删除设备人员');load()}
const resize=()=>mobile.value=innerWidth<768;onMounted(()=>{addEventListener('resize',resize);load()});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{removeEventListener('resize',resize);clearEventPhotos();if(scanTimer)clearInterval(scanTimer);if(cardScanTimer)clearInterval(cardScanTimer)});watch(()=>props.section,load)
</script>

<style scoped>
.page{padding:20px}.page-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:flex-start}.page-head h2{margin:0}.page-head p{color:#6b7280;margin:8px 0 16px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.card,.panel,.filters{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px}.card span{color:#6b7280}.card strong{font-size:30px;display:block;margin-top:8px;color:#1f2937}.panel h3{margin:0 0 14px}.filters{display:flex;gap:10px}.filters .el-input{max-width:360px}.safe-tip{display:flex;gap:12px;background:#fff7e6;border:1px solid #ffd591;color:#874d00;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:12px}.dialog-form{margin-top:16px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.grid .wide{grid-column:1/-1}.dialog-form :deep(.el-select),.dialog-form :deep(.el-date-editor){width:100%}
.probe-result{margin:0 0 16px 100px;padding:12px;background:#f0f9eb;border:1px solid #b3e19d;border-radius:6px;display:grid;gap:5px;color:#3d6b27}.probe-result b{color:#2b7a0b}
.future-upload{margin:0 0 14px 95px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f5f7fa;color:#6b7280;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}
.scan-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.scan-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;margin:14px 0}.scan-cards div{background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:6px;padding:12px;text-align:center}.scan-cards b{display:block;font-size:24px;color:#2563eb}.scan-cards span{color:#6b7280;font-size:13px}
.face-title{margin-top:18px!important}.face-box{min-height:150px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:18px}.face-box img{max-width:220px;max-height:260px;border-radius:6px;object-fit:contain}
.photo-input{max-width:190px}.file-name{display:block;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.visitor-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}.visitor-photos div{min-height:180px;background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:center}.visitor-photos b{align-self:flex-start}.visitor-photos img{width:100%;height:230px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px;background:#fff}
.visitor-photos img{cursor:zoom-in}.photo-error{color:#d93026;padding:50px 10px;text-align:center}
.replace-face{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px;margin:-6px 0 18px;background:#fff7e6;border:1px solid #ffd591;border-radius:6px}.replace-face span{color:#874d00;font-size:13px}
.page :deep(.event-thumb){width:58px;height:42px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid #dcdfe6;cursor:zoom-in;display:block}.photo-loading{font-size:12px;color:#909399}.event-photo-view{min-height:220px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#111;border-radius:8px;cursor:zoom-out}.event-photo-view img{max-width:100%;max-height:72vh;object-fit:contain}.event-photo-tip{text-align:center;color:#909399;margin:10px 0 0}
.event-pagination{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:2px}
@media(max-width:768px){.page{padding:10px}.page-head{display:block}.actions{margin-bottom:10px}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.card{padding:12px;margin:0}.card strong{font-size:24px}.panel{padding:10px;overflow:hidden}.filters{display:grid}.filters .el-input{max-width:none}.grid{display:block}.safe-tip{display:block}.safe-tip span{display:block;margin-top:5px}.probe-result,.future-upload{margin-left:0}.scan-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.visitor-photos{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visitor-photos img{height:auto;max-height:320px}.page :deep(.el-dialog){width:calc(100vw - 20px)!important}.page :deep(.el-table){font-size:12px}}
</style>
